 623:./ucOSII/Core/os_q.c **** *                                       POST MESSAGE TO A QUEUE
 624:./ucOSII/Core/os_q.c **** *
 625:./ucOSII/Core/os_q.c **** * Description: This function sends a message to a queue
 626:./ucOSII/Core/os_q.c **** *
